WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.209
The guided practice combines several patterns We
want patients who satisfy

00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:11.868
four conditions Instead of writing one long query
immediately test

00:00:11.894 --> 00:00:19.101
each condition separately First the scalar age
benchmark Then

00:00:19.128 --> 00:00:25.948
the admission count Then abnormal-lab existence Then

00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:31.628
the medication count Finally combine the verified
conditions with

00:00:31.654 --> 00:00:31.944
AND
